      "text": "Nephi1 sees multitudes who had not fallen because of terrible judgments of the Lord, 1 Ne. 12:5. terrible gulf divides building and tree, 1 Ne. 12:18. the Lord shall lop bough with terror, 2 Ne. 20:33 (Isa. 10:33). terrible battle between Nephites and armies of Giddianhi, 3 Ne. 4:7. terrible tempest at death of Christ, 3 Ne. 8:6. O that we had repented before great and terrible day, 3 Ne. 8:24–25. terror for oppressions shall not come near thee, 3 Ne. 22:14 (Isa. 54:14). every soul filled with terror because of greatness of Lamanites’ numbers, Morm. 6:8. Jaredite vessels buried in sea because of terrible tempests, Ether 6:6.",
